{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p007a","title":"裴松之追述许褚救曹操渡潼关","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p007a-account","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之以潼关危急非许褚不济，论不祀许褚之疑。","evidence":["shaodi-e-p007a-q"]},{"id":"lizang-a-495a85eeb4de50c3235a","label":"正文","text":"太祖将北渡先渡兵，独与褚及虎士百余人留南岸断后","evidence":["lizang-q-aac1b8847da35ff3a588"]},{"id":"lizang-a-d8136d9f90d677f6596b","label":"正文","text":"马超将步骑万余人来奔太祖军，矢下如雨","evidence":["lizang-q-64261683cf796f5f558f"]},{"id":"lizang-a-584c4dd189f07d096012","label":"正文","text":"褚白太祖贼来多兵渡已尽宜去，乃扶太祖上船","evidence":["lizang-q-45f654dd4617df113d9a"]},{"id":"lizang-a-5b07b4a9f2e58713ff57","label":"正文","text":"船重欲没，褚斩攀船者举马鞍蔽太祖，船工中矢死，褚并泝船仅乃得渡","evidence":["lizang-q-ac9643e206a986dcd7a4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0015","role":"救护","evidence":["shaodi-e-p007a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"留南岸断后；军被奔；上船；仅乃得渡","evidence":["lizang-q-aac1b8847da35ff3a588","lizang-q-64261683cf796f5f558f","lizang-q-45f654dd4617df113d9a","lizang-q-ac9643e206a986dcd7a4"]},{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"将步骑来奔太祖军","evidence":["lizang-q-64261683cf796f5f558f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"潼关之危","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["shaodi-e-p007a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-p007a-q","source_order":[4,108,"P007a"],"order":1026}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0015","name":"许褚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-45f654dd4617df113d9a","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2f49f2df7036dd2f32dd","layer":"original","quote":"褚白太祖：“贼来多，今兵渡已尽，宜去！”乃扶太祖上船","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":64,"end":90},{"id":"lizang-q-64261683cf796f5f558f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2f49f2df7036dd2f32dd","layer":"original","quote":"超将步骑万余人，来奔太祖军〖12〗，矢下如雨","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":63},{"id":"lizang-q-aac1b8847da35ff3a588","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2f49f2df7036dd2f32dd","layer":"original","quote":"太祖将北渡，临济河，先渡兵；独与褚及虎士百余人，留南岸断后","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":40},{"id":"lizang-q-ac9643e206a986dcd7a4","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2f49f2df7036dd2f32dd","layer":"original","quote":"贼战急，军急济，船重欲没；褚斩攀船者，左手举马鞍蔽太祖。船工为流矢所中，死；褚右手并泝船〖13〗，仅乃得渡","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":91,"end":144},{"id":"shaodi-e-p007a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cb89d7aac39e4f2b986e","layer":"pei","quote":"且潼关之危，非褚不济；","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3d1da4e489a1fb153ea2","start":80,"end":91}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
